selstroombronnen die ervoor zorgen dat je systeem altijd voldoende energie heeft, zelfs bij zwak zonlicht of slecht weer. Diverse oplaadopties voldoen aan verschillende oplaadbehoeften in verschillende scenario's.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-k2u470laucm" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom-element ecom-base-image" deep="1"><figure><div class="ecom-container-image ecom-image-align" data-stopdrag=""><div data-stopdrag="" class="ecom-image-content-position ecom-image-default ecom-base-image-container-overlay" style=""><picture class="ecom-image-picture"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0920/2132/6147/files/Group_156.png?v=1748514977"><img loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0920/2132/6147/files/Group_154.png?v=1746693751" alt="Group_154" width="670" height="610"></picture></div></div></figure></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-l88no4d119i" data-id="ecom-l88no4d119i" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="1" class="core__row--columns"></div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-5tptl0t8uh5" data-id="ecom-5tptl0t8uh5" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="1" class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core ecom-dik26ey3mf8"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-6iac8eohgpc" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h2 class="ecom__heading ecom-db">0% Energieverspilling</h2></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-1tvnkndmiml" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Wanneer de elektriciteitsmeter detecteert dat overtollige energie teruggeleverd kan worden aan het net, slaat de BK1600-energieopslag deze energie op in de batterij. Deze intelligente regeling maximaliseert de energie-efficiëntie en helpt je moeiteloos energieverspilling te voorkomen.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-jef81d3zxbm" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom-element ecom-base-image" deep="1"><figure><div class="ecom-container-image ecom-image-align" data-stopdrag=""><div data-stopdrag="" class="ecom-image-content-position ecom-image-default ecom-base-image-container-overlay" style=""><picture class="ecom-image-picture"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0920/2132/6147/files/1_82a72495-5a8b-4918-b897-2831c4e7ef07.png?v=1749456291"><img loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0920/2132/6147/files/PC_05fa1b86-6630-4f54-9e98-cbba06ba3fdc.png?v=1749456228" alt="PC_05fa1b86-6630-4f54-9e98-cbba06ba3fdc" width="846" height="476"></picture></div></div></figure></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-kpdxq8nnyg" data-id="ecom-kpdxq8nnyg" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="1" class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core ecom-lw2700wlj"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-m2bh27i3qhp" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h2 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>Dynamisch Elektriciteitstarief</b></h2></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-vveks2qxrr" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Met de Indevolt-app ontvang je real-time meldingen over elektriciteitsprijzen en kun je eenvoudig je oplaad- en ontlaadplannen beheren. Stel je doelprijs in, en het systeem laadt automatisch op bij lage prijzen en ontlaadt bij hoge prijzen. Bespaar geld en verdien extra inkomen!</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-0kx3h2bu8e6q hide-on-mobile" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__video ecom-element" deep="1"><div class="ecom-element_video-iframe ecom-element-overlay"><video id="ecom-elements__popup-video-ecom-0kx3h2bu8e6q" class="ecom_video" autoplay="" loop="" playsinline="true" preload="true" muted="" style="display: flex !important;"><source src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/vp/c10e605cc3554a90873af67c73e49345/c10e605cc3554a90873af67c73e49345.HD-1080p-2.5Mbps-46782182.mp4" data-source="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/vp/c10e605cc3554a90873af67c73e49345/c10e605cc3554a90873af67c73e49345.HD-1080p-2.5Mbps-46782182.mp4"></video></div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-1wvo2exhhfm hide-on-desktop hide-on-tablet" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__video ecom-element" deep="1"><div class="ecom-element_video-iframe ecom-element-overlay"><video id="ecom-elements__popup-video-ecom-1wvo2exhhfm" class="ecom_video" autoplay="" loop="" playsinline="true" preload="true" muted="" style="display: flex !important;"><source src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/vp/e6e711501b6044cbae3f883178631e77/e6e711501b6044cbae3f883178631e77.SD-480p-1.5Mbps-46782443.mp4" data-source="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/vp/e6e711501b6044cbae3f883178631e77/e6e711501b6044cbae3f883178631e77.SD-480p-1.5Mbps-46782443.mp4"></video></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-32dctzt1f17" data-id="ecom-32dctzt1f17" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="1" class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core ecom-9h2aa807aq"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-v80s2m8l2l" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h2 class="ecom__heading ecom-db">Bespaar Efficiënter op Elektriciteitskosten met AI</h2></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-gxa0c7qnp5a" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Indevolt Smart AI ontwikkelt op maat gemaakte energiebeheeroplossingen op basis van nauwkeurige big data-analyse. Door historische elektriciteitsverbruiksdata te gebruiken en rekening te houden met weerfactoren, voorspelt onze technologie je uurlijkse elektriciteitsverbruik voor de dag. Tegelijkertijd schatten we de verwachte zonne-energieopbrengst op basis van de weersvoorspelling en de prestaties van je fotovoltaïsche systeem. Dankzij de integratie van dynamische elektriciteitsprijzen en actuele batterijstatusinformatie kun je de kosten per kilowattuur in real-time volgen. Op deze manier bepalen we automatisch de optimale oplaad- en ontlaadstrategieën om je energiekosten te maximaliseren en energiefacturering te optimaliseren.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-wayc4q3bnjn" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom-element ecom-base-image" deep="1"><figure><div class="ecom-container-image e